{
  "prefix": "PRB-",
  "directory": "problems",
  "idField": "problem_id",
  "sourceModel": "docs/models/problem-model.md",
  "notes": "domain accepts either a single string or a list of domain codes; docs/models/problem-model.md shows a single string, but multi-domain problems (see WU-D1-02) are recorded as a list, consistent with the existing evidence.domain list convention. No enum is enforced on domain values. decision_basis is an OPTIONAL v0 (IPE-01) structure — see docs/discovery/investigation-promotion-engine.md. It is never required and no existing canonical PRB-* is backfilled with it. contract_version is a free-form string, not enum-checked, so future decision_basis contract revisions do not require a schema/validator change merely to be recorded. decision_basis.scope.bounded (added IPE-02, docs/discovery/investigation-promotion-engine.md §10) is an explicit human-authored boolean, never inferred from scope.geography/population/temporal text; booleanFields enforces it is true|false when present, not merely truthy.",
